  "bio": "Enrico Imbornone is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Bournemouth, United Kingdom, specializing in fineline tattoos that are perfect for fans of anime, manga, and cartoons. His precise technique and attention to detail make each piece a unique work of art, reflecting his dedication to the craft. As a Sicilian tattooer in the UK, Enrico brings a touch of Mediterranean flair to every design he creates.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bournemouth, England, United Kingdom"
